{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:37Z","created_by_operation":"op_fe820e249ea641c4825409391282114e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_343e4a063e6081fd5573b2f5f1c60e6573398ec21db5860274d87aef4aecbac7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"avelikiy/great_cto@5ca5a322ac7a snapshot 8463cdb3ab3d551e","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_63aceb92324bd983fbadcf582db655d11e8195de4b72f9eb8b13cea5470e6bee"],"source_ids":["src_1a415f8d2a32571a93cdadc5310d1391"],"text":"The tool is positioned for a solo builder, is not a CI/CD system (gates run locally, merging still goes through GitHub Actions), and is not certification-audited despite PCI/HIPAA/SOC2 scaffolds.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:37Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fe820e249ea641c4825409391282114e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:37Z","created_by_operation":"op_fe820e249ea641c4825409391282114e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_357c787f72ec9f8643146ba754680d5fe9c262c996f95ce0ed67be5910ace9a8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"avelikiy/great_cto@5ca5a322ac7a snapshot 8463cdb3ab3d551e","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2e6711c331884839106c2d3515a23a9e9c395b3e6bd368f53742872d49af8271"],"source_ids":["src_1a415f8d2a32571a93cdadc5310d1391"],"text":"The product follows a rule that a thing which did not happen must never look like one that did: missing harnesses show 'unavailable', undecidable checks show 'unverifiable', unmeasured costs show 'unmeasured', and unassessed stages show 'null'.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:37Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fe820e249ea641c4825409391282114e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:37Z","created_by_operation":"op_fe820e249ea641c4825409391282114e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_83bbf83f043afe56f460a5fbfff429d2431be07c2e2b9543f12d89ff5366201a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"avelikiy/great_cto@5ca5a322ac7a snapshot 8463cdb3ab3d551e","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0b9a61bf2e38e651615b43d18d129c0204362465e2446af6513a070cb31742f7","slc_2d51649fd0476930ce1031c983f5f69ac7f43089a268566d94b9386eb2581306"],"source_ids":["src_1a415f8d2a32571a93cdadc5310d1391"],"text":"An open benchmark built seven products with a median token cost of $171 and a median quality score of 70/100 (range 58-86), measured 2026-07-10, with a reproduction doc cited.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:37Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fe820e249ea641c4825409391282114e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:37Z","created_by_operation":"op_fe820e249ea641c4825409391282114e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8dc8aecfab573f92199621de441a22961d79b3f5f571affc8c2de10711d98420","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"avelikiy/great_cto@5ca5a322ac7a snapshot 8463cdb3ab3d551e","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1e3d0c2a07beb6eeca56f91442f53b6f8783f8ddb09fcd2fda3aebbe45156f59"],"source_ids":["src_1a415f8d2a32571a93cdadc5310d1391"],"text":"An 'approval-level' setting in .great_cto/PROJECT.md controls where the pipeline stops, from 'auto' (0 stops) through the default 'gates-only' (3 stops) to 'ship-only' (1 stop at deploy).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:37Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fe820e249ea641c4825409391282114e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:37Z","created_by_operation":"op_fe820e249ea641c4825409391282114e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8dd84f5bd01fbe557570566361b745db9fa9c30cc8470f57990825892fd4fc86","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"avelikiy/great_cto@5ca5a322ac7a snapshot 8463cdb3ab3d551e","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9dce61fe34b79cc5a0dfff02460b126e035c45945725c902a8c2abb5655de875"],"source_ids":["src_1a415f8d2a32571a93cdadc5310d1391"],"text":"The system uses about 70 specialized agents with their own review gates, plus critics for architecture, spec, and schema that run before planning.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:37Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fe820e249ea641c4825409391282114e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:37Z","created_by_operation":"op_fe820e249ea641c4825409391282114e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9247e38aeafdcac56ad862f87a6b2a007648cff57e911193c9abe00e4aba06a3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"avelikiy/great_cto@5ca5a322ac7a snapshot 8463cdb3ab3d551e","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9dce61fe34b79cc5a0dfff02460b126e035c45945725c902a8c2abb5655de875","slc_a2d2d66a21a70c54e413504792dea4d28407e56e64d3dd9bee34cd9c67618cff"],"source_ids":["src_1a415f8d2a32571a93cdadc5310d1391"],"text":"Per-agent budgets in PROJECT.md ('agent-budgets:') make the pipeline decline to dispatch past a stage's spending cap and name the number; unmeasured runs hold nothing rather than firing a budget.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:37Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fe820e249ea641c4825409391282114e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:37Z","created_by_operation":"op_fe820e249ea641c4825409391282114e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_99479fa51bd5985c8294ab5a99f7247e2a4aa46c54d5309e064558fda6c640f4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"avelikiy/great_cto@5ca5a322ac7a snapshot 8463cdb3ab3d551e","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6bdbfdc47844f13dc00dec8f0e4956983f0a8c0374819cfbc76fa300d2b88289","slc_9438d2464c477e213f2d2b4530df7c7e3e4f2d1baaaa911d250585b9c1177ab1","slc_d341250e5efa270614a1a8a6e9a9298bdf5f944c9b26e2c6bbf3649fe916300d"],"source_ids":["src_3f0fd68b192b5c29ab9cb28493567cde"],"text":"Repository development practice: agents working in this repo must never mention private project names in public-facing artifacts, using the placeholder <private-project> instead, enforced by a pre-push hook.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:37Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fe820e249ea641c4825409391282114e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:37Z","created_by_operation":"op_fe820e249ea641c4825409391282114e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a1a9b07908cbf11b42acb8181063dab2f31c39add148e38b04094ce7464f918d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"avelikiy/great_cto@5ca5a322ac7a snapshot 8463cdb3ab3d551e","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8e550ba14ec46ac53c1b23b4de1b2d4c38e04b4404dab4fefb5de36b74ab4134","slc_fe9593e77feaba6d91ed83c04d770415eedf3c1d0de4f8769c0f513e9f346b39"],"source_ids":["src_1a415f8d2a32571a93cdadc5310d1391"],"text":"The tool installs via 'npx great-cto init', with an '--host codex' variant that installs skills and an MCP server instead of the Claude Code pipeline.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:37Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fe820e249ea641c4825409391282114e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:37Z","created_by_operation":"op_fe820e249ea641c4825409391282114e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a835415e02ad16f0407f9e24caddc775f9b1eec121875e7db2508c41299ad028","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"avelikiy/great_cto@5ca5a322ac7a snapshot 8463cdb3ab3d551e","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b769f574a4761b7eea0c62b8e0cf1b4028890d727650f759ec77a18ca012ab2c"],"source_ids":["src_1a415f8d2a32571a93cdadc5310d1391"],"text":"Requires Node >= 18.17; companion plugins Superpowers and Beads install automatically, and users are told to verify the plugin loaded via 'claude plugin list --json'.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:37Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fe820e249ea641c4825409391282114e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:37Z","created_by_operation":"op_fe820e249ea641c4825409391282114e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b4ece05db271e7b785e8b76c07d13d0091a61cd39da34f92b9e556f52a692644","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"avelikiy/great_cto@5ca5a322ac7a snapshot 8463cdb3ab3d551e","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9dce61fe34b79cc5a0dfff02460b126e035c45945725c902a8c2abb5655de875"],"source_ids":["src_1a415f8d2a32571a93cdadc5310d1391"],"text":"Agents are scope-restricted at write time: an agent is described as physically unable to touch files outside its brief, refused at write rather than flagged at review.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:37Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fe820e249ea641c4825409391282114e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:37Z","created_by_operation":"op_fe820e249ea641c4825409391282114e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c12ac87655548397741ee5fc5c9baac9ba426fe75d7a8e39cb34b900f06fa78b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"avelikiy/great_cto@5ca5a322ac7a snapshot 8463cdb3ab3d551e","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_63aceb92324bd983fbadcf582db655d11e8195de4b72f9eb8b13cea5470e6bee"],"source_ids":["src_1a415f8d2a32571a93cdadc5310d1391"],"text":"Per-agent cost attribution is unreliable: cost is read from the host's session transcript, which covers the session rather than one subagent, so per-agent figures can be inflated and should be treated as a ceiling.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:37Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fe820e249ea641c4825409391282114e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:37Z","created_by_operation":"op_fe820e249ea641c4825409391282114e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_da8a421c9a09af8d21dbd6faaccee8c984b7ecd6ca1ce6e462151baabec59d33","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"avelikiy/great_cto@5ca5a322ac7a snapshot 8463cdb3ab3d551e","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1d251347ab97934e86a625ca8cd78771c1a3885c95a780af33938db31ce61703"],"source_ids":["src_1a415f8d2a32571a93cdadc5310d1391"],"text":"Users interact via slash commands: /start to describe a product or feature and run the pipeline, /inbox for pending gates and blocked tasks, and /digest for weekly DORA metrics and cost roll-ups.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:37Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fe820e249ea641c4825409391282114e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:37Z","created_by_operation":"op_fe820e249ea641c4825409391282114e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_db82df4765a4cfebb97d5f475084d7a7464cb3c9496f7b4694fbf4ca96061f68","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"avelikiy/great_cto@5ca5a322ac7a snapshot 8463cdb3ab3d551e","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_729c8e635eba9fb8647bcc02e505a9c1f28ed1bd1b3d1fe7efaf63c84f745a77","slc_7480df50626d5a304a1be736f824dc34734ae6871216956ba00cac929a554e08","slc_7c96097c91f13d0feb5a152fd771cbf8d918e47b021b05ede044b6a1778d6827","slc_d60141cb227b6f660ab0556c81f7dfb55c0abffb38f2d44333fae1caf1c966df"],"source_ids":["src_02944e151ae5523cb593f8eaf99a4b44"],"text":"Repository development practice: AGENTS.md mandates the bd (beads) issue tracker for all task tracking, non-interactive shell flags, and a mandatory session-completion workflow ending in a successful git push.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:37Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fe820e249ea641c4825409391282114e"}
